{"name": "Golemworks", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Golemworks\u00a0</i></strong>is an experimental, strategic fusion of roguelike and factory builder. You must assemble a factory that generates an army of automatons. These automatons automatically fight and defend your golem foundry from waves of encroaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"232\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.poster.avif?t=1786591852\" width=\"708\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.webm?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/12cc25cd3aa2d9b4edf2a9f0ff9c1e92.mp4?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Molds</strong> activate on a cooldown, and generate a golem core - the 'recipe' for an automaton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.poster.avif?t=1786591852\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.webm?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/084a7f978c195895b5575abebaf2c477.mp4?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catalysts</strong>\u00a0are the production infrastructure. They can add levels, add elemental attributes, or otherwise alter a core </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"384\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.poster.avif?t=1786591852\" width=\"520\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.webm?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/5596dc08a7836a4e01ad5860448d47a0.mp4?t=1786591852\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival will hinge on your ability to optimize the strength of your golem army. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable golem upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenges and varying difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All in-game art drawn by hand in Aseprite. Capsule art by @afique_asyraf</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Assemble a factory, manufacture golems, and defend yourself from ruin in this strategic automation roguelike.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/3b472ef1d35ad1243546b4efa82aacf0cbb21240/header.jpg?t=1786591852", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Automation", "Roguelike", "Difficult", "Tower Defense", "Experimental"], "developers": "evilalbert", "publishers": "evilalbert", "release_date": "Mar 16, 2026", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3918970", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bW-pdgCjzHk", "first_seen": 1768608000.0, "review_rank": 1373}